ит аккуратно."},{"date":"2024-05-10","author":"Sophie","rating":5,"textEn":"We had a great day trip to Mtskheta. Gocha knows good history.","textRu":"У нас была отличная однодневная поездка в Мцхету. Гоча знает историю."},{"date":"2024-05-25","author":"Ali","rating":5,"textEn":"Gocha stopped for us to buy wine and churchkhela. Very patient.","textRu":"Гоча остановился, чтобы мы купили вино и чурчхелу. Очень терпеливый."},{"date":"2024-06-15","author":"Kate","rating":5,"textEn":"Comfortable van for 6 people. Thanks Gocha!","textRu":"Удобный фургон для 6 человек. Спасибо, Гоча!"},{"date":"2024-07-05","author":"Dmitry","rating":5,"textEn":"Gocha meets you like a friend. Very hospitable.","textRu":"Гоча встречает как друга. Очень гостеприимный."},{"date":"2024-07-25","author":"Liam","rating":5,"textEn":"Reliable transfer to Gudauri. Snow was not a problem.","textRu":"Надежный трансфер в Гудаури. Снег не был проблемой."},{"date":"2024-08-10","author":"Zoe","rating":5,"textEn":"Car was clean and Gocha offered us Georgian music.","textRu":"Машина была чистой, и Гоча предложил нам грузинскую музыку."},{"date":"2024-08-30","author":"Hiro","rating":5,"textEn":"Safe driver.","textRu":"Безопасный водитель."},{"date":"2024-09-15","author":"Elena","rating":5,"textEn":"Gocha waited for us when our flight was delayed. Thank you!","textRu":"Гоча подождал нас, когда наш рейс задержали. Спасибо!"},{"date":"2024-10-05","author":"Mark","rating":5,"textEn":"Great price for a minivan. Gocha is honest.","textRu":"Отличная цена за минивэн. Гоча честный."},{"date":"2024-10-25","author":"Svetlana","rating":5,"textEn":"We enjoyed the conversation with Gocha.","textRu":"Нам понравилась беседа с Гочей."},{"date":"2024-11-10","author":"Pedro","rating":5,"textEn":"Good AC, very important in summer.","textRu":"Хороший кондиционер, очень важно летом."},{"date":"2024-12-01","author":"Maria","rating":5,"textEn":"Gocha helped us with bags.","textRu":"Гоча помог нам с сумками."},{"date":"2024-12-20","author":"John","rating":5,"textEn":"Smooth driving.","textRu":"Плавное вождение."},{"date":"2025-01-05","author":"Linda","rating":5,"textEn":"Recommended!","textRu":"Рекомендую!"},{"date":"2025-01-10","author":"Igor","rating":5,"textEn":"Gocha is a pro.","textRu":"Гоча профи."},{"date":"2025-01-14","author":"Sam","rating":5,"textEn":"Thanks for the trip to Dashbashi.","textRu":"Спасибо за поездку в Дашбаши."},{"date":"2025-01-15","author":"Nina","rating":5,"textEn":"Very kind driver.","textRu":"Очень добрый водитель."},{"date":"2025-01-16","author":"Oleg","rating":5,"textEn":"5 stars.","textRu":"5 звезд."},{"date":"2025-01-16","author":"Tako","rating":5,"textEn":"Madloba Gocha!","textRu":"Спасибо, Гоча!"}]', '2026-01-15T19:24:28.958901+00:00', 0, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.drivers (id, name, email, password, phone_number, city, photo_url, car_model, car_photo_url, car_photos, vehicle_type, status, rating, review_count, price_per_km, base_price, max_passengers, languages, features, blocked_dates, documents, reviews, created_at, debt, last_login) VALUES ('drv-1768646026879', 'Leri ', 'elitetransfergeorgia@gmail.com', 'Elitenini2006$', '+995591209120', 'tbilisi', 'https://fhfkdadxvpmmioikkwex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-gallery/drivers/drv-1768646026879/avatar/1768646026880_s0zj9.jpeg', 'Mersedes benc v klass', 'https://fhfkdadxvpmmioikkwex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-gallery/drivers/drv-1768646026879/car_front/1768646029416_svsay.jpeg', '["https://fhfkdadxvpmmioikkwex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-gallery/drivers/drv-1768646026879/car_back/1768646030694_q1fbz.jpeg","https://fhfkdadxvpmmioikkwex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-gallery/drivers/drv-1768646026879/car_side/1768646031867_jmst9.jpeg","https://fhfkdadxvpmmioikkwex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-gallery/drivers/drv-1768646026879/car_interior/1768646032941_7n1oi.jpeg"]', 'Minivan', 'ACTIVE', 5, 22, 1, 99, 4, '["EN"]', '["WiFi","AC","Non-Smoking","Child Seat","Water","Roof Box"]', '[]', '[{"url":"https://fhfkdadxvpmmioikkwex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-gallery/documents/drv-1768646026879/1768646034292_tsb10.jpg","type":"LICENSE","uploadedAt":1768646039676},{"url":"https://fhfkdadxvpmmioikkwex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-gallery/documents/drv-1768646026879/1768646039676_5b5bk.jpeg","type":"TECH_PASSPORT","uploadedAt":1768646048913}]', '[{"date":"2024-04-10","author":"Family Thompson","rating":5,"textEn":"The Mercedes V-Class was pure luxury! Leri is a true professional.","textRu":"Mercedes V-Class — это чистая роскошь! Лери — настоящий профессионал."},{"date":"2024-04-25","author":"Group from Dubai","rating":5,"textEn":"Leri handled our large group perfectly. Plenty of space for luggage.","textRu":"Лери отлично справился с нашей большой группой. Много места для багажа."},{"date":"2024-05-15","author":"Oleg K.","rating":5,"textEn":"Very comfortable minivan. Leri drives very smoothly.","textRu":"Очень комфортабельный минивэн. Лери водит очень плавно."},{"date":"2024-06-01","author":"Sarah & Friends","rating":5,"textEn":"We toured Kakheti with Leri. He knows all the best wineries!","textRu":"Мы путешествовали по Кахетии с Лери. Он знает все лучшие винодельни!"},{"date":"2024-06-20","author":"Hassan","rating":5,"textEn":"Premium service. Leri was dressed nicely and car was spotless.","textRu":"Премиальный сервис. Лери был хорошо одет, а машина безупречна."},{"date":"2024-07-10","author":"Elena","rating":5,"textEn":"Best choice for a family trip. Kids slept all the way.","textRu":"Лучший выбор для семейной поездки. Дети спали всю дорогу."},{"date":"2024-07-30","author":"Thomas","rating":5,"textEn":"Leri speaks great English. Very helpful with our itinerary.","textRu":"Лери отлично говорит по-английски. Очень помог с нашим маршрутом."},{"date":"2024-08-15","author":"Wang","rating":5,"textEn":"The AC in the V-Class is amazing. Saved us from the heat.","textRu":"Кондиционер в V-Class потрясающий. Спас нас от жары."},{"date":"2024-09-05","author":"Isabella","rating":5,"textEn":"Leri is a safe driver. We went to Kazbegi and felt very secure.","textRu":"Лери — безопасный водитель. Мы ездили в Казбеги и чувствовали себя в безопасности."},{"date":"2024-09-25","author":"Dmitry","rating":5,"textEn":"High level transfer. Thank you Leri.","textRu":"Трансфер высокого уровня. Спасибо, Лери."},{"date":"2024-10-10","author":"John D.","rating":5,"textEn":"Leri arrived early and helped load all our bags.","textRu":"Лери приехал пораньше и помог загрузить все наши сумки."},{"date":"2024-10-28","author":"Maria","rating":5,"textEn":"Very spacious car. Leri is polite and quiet.","textRu":"Очень просторная машина. Лери вежливый и тихий."},{"date":"2024-11-15","author":"Robert","rating":5,"textEn":"Business class experience with Leri.","textRu":"Опыт бизнес-класса с Лери."},{"date":"2024-12-05","author":"Yoko","rating":5,"textEn":"We loved the trip to Borjomi.","textRu":"Нам очень понравилась поездка в Боржоми."},{"date":"2024-12-25","author":"Sergey V.","rating":5,"textEn":"Leri drove us in snow safely.","textRu":"Лери безопасно вез нас по снегу."},{"date":"2025-01-05","author":"Paul","rating":5,"textEn":"Great value for such a luxury car.","textRu":"Отличная цена за такую роскошную машину."},{"date":"2025-01-10","author":"Anna","rating":5,"textEn":"Leri is the best!","textRu":"Лери лучший!"},{"date":"2025-01-12","author":"Kim","rating":5,"textEn":"Water bottles provided for everyone. Nice touch.","textRu":"Всем дали бутылки с водой. Приятная деталь."},{"date":"2025-01-14","author":"Max","rating":5,"textEn":"Recommended for groups.","textRu":"Рекомендую для групп."},{"date":"2025-01-15","author":"Olga","rating":5,"textEn":"Cleanest minivan in Tbilisi.","textRu":"Самый чистый минивэн в Тбилиси."},{"date":"2025-01-16","author":"Tom","rating":5,"textEn":"Thanks Leri!","textRu":"Спасибо, Лери!"},{"date":"2025-01-16","author":"Giga","rating":5,"textEn":"Super.","textRu":"Супер."}]', '2026-01-17T10:34:13.82166+00:00', 0, NULL);
